      "timestamp": "25:01",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "There's many steps throughout the way during that 18 months. Depositions are taken, discovery is propounded and answered to. At some point a case will get to mediation. It is required to mediate a case before going to trial. I would say probably 70% of cases are settled in mediation."
