      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Before we move on, is there anything about how you practice or how the Eberst Law Firm operates that might surprise people, something that's not typical in personal injury law? I would say the number one thing to consider with us is that we do prepare every case as if it was gonna go into litigation and go to trial."
